## API Route Details

### GET /health
Return `{ status: 'ok', timestamp: new Date().toISOString() }`

### GET /api/projects
Query all projects from DB, return as JSON array.
For scaffolding: if DB is unavailable, return mock data.

### POST /api/projects
Validate body with `CreateProjectSchema` from @chief-mog/types.
Insert into DB, return created project with 201.
For scaffolding: validate input, return mock created project.

### GET /api/projects/:id
Lookup by ID, return 404 if not found.

### POST /api/projects/:id/analyze
Enqueue a BullMQ job `{ name: 'analysis.run', data: { projectId } }`.
Return `{ status: 'queued', jobId }` with 202.

### GET /api/projects/:id/opportunities
Query opportunities by projectId, return as JSON array.

